 `POST /events` `{name, properties?, timestamp?, session_id?}` → 201 event incl. `tenant_id` from auth context. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:38\n- [ ] Missing `name` → 400. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:50\n- [ ] `POST /events/batch` `{events: [...]}` → 201 `{inserted, events}`. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:59\n- [ ] Empty batch → 400. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:76\n- [ ] tenant_id always taken from `req.user.tenantId`, not body. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:85\n- [ ] Custom timestamp preserved verbatim in response. Test: ingest.unit.test.ts:95\n\n## 3. Query (`src/query/router.ts`) — default export Express Router, expects `req.user`\n- [ ] `POST /query/count` `{event_name, start?, end?}` → 200 `{count}`, scoped to tenant. Test: query.unit.test.ts:54,64\n- [ ] Missing `event_name` → 400. Test: query.unit.test.ts:122\n- [ ] `POST /query/timeseries` `{event_name, bucket}` → 200 `{data: [{bucket,count}]}`. Test: query.unit.test.ts:78\n- [ ] `POST /query/breakdown` `{event_name, property_key}` → 200 `{data: [{property_value,count}]}`. Test: query.unit.test.ts:91\n- [ ] `POST /query/funnel` `{steps: string[]}` → 200 `{steps: [{step,count}]}`, monotonically non-increasing counts. Test: query.unit.test.ts:108\n- [ ] All queries strictly scoped by `req.user.tenantId` (tenant isolation, integration.test.ts:178).\n\n## 4. Dashboards (`src/dashboards/router.ts`) — default export Express Router, expects `req.user`\n- [ ] `POST /dashboards` `{name, config?}` → 201 dashboard incl. tenant_id. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:42\n- [ ] `GET /dashboards` → 200 array of tenant's dashboards. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:54\n- [ ] `GET /dashboards/:id` → 200 dashboard + `widgets: []`; 404 if not found or wrong tenant. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:65, integration.test.ts:477\n- [ ] `PATCH /dashboards/:id` `{name?, config?}` → 200 updated. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:79\n- [ ] `DELETE /dashboards/:id` → 204; subsequent GET → 404. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:94\n- [ ] `POST /dashboards/:id/widgets` `{type, config?, position_x?, position_y?, width?, height?}` → 201 widget incl. `dashboard_id`. Test: dashboards.unit.test.ts:108\n- [ ] `DELETE /dashboards/:id/widgets/:widgetId` → 204. Test: integration.test.ts:292\n- [ ] Tenant isolation on all dashboard ops. Test: integration.test.ts:457\n\n## 5. Export (`src/export/router.ts`) — default export Express Router, expects `req.user`\n- [ ] `GET /export/events?format=json` → 200 array, tenant-scoped. Test: export.unit.test.ts:52,73\n- [ ] `GET /export/events?format=csv` → 200 text/csv, header + N rows. Test: export.unit.test.ts:62\n- [ ] Invalid format → 400. Test: export.unit.test.ts:110\n- [ ] `GET /export/dashboard/:id` → 200 `{dashboard, widgets}`; 404 if missing/wrong tenant. Test: export.unit.test.ts:83,103, integration.test.ts:516\n\n## Integration / cross-cutting (tests/integration.test.ts)\n- [ ] `createApp()` in `src/app.ts` assembles a full app with real JWT auth.\n- [ ] Unauthenticated requests to protected routes → 401 `{error, code}` (code is a string; matches \"AUTH_ERROR\" only guaranteed for invalid-token case, but consistent shape required for missing-auth case too).\n- [ ] Invalid bearer token → 401 `{error, code: 'AUTH_ERROR'}` for `/users/me`, `/events`, `/dashboards`.\n- [ ] Full workflow: register → login → ingest → query → dashboard → widget → export, all consistent.\n- [ ] Tenant isolation holds across ingest/query/dashboards/export.\n\n## Build & Lint\n- [ ] `npm run build` (tsc, strict) compiles cleanly.\n- [ ] `npm run lint` (eslint) clean.\n- [ ] `npm test` (vitest run) — all tests pass.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":760,"cache_read_input_tokens":53906,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":760},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id